Dear Alan your problem is caused by the security mup you installed before you upgraded 
from version 5.5 to 5.5-2. The solution is to rename te images that where affected by 
the security mup called -- CSCPAT_1084 V1.0

The images affected are 

          SYS$COMMON:[SYS$LDR]PAGE_MANAGEMENT.EXE
          SYS$COMMON:[SYS$LDR]IMAGE_MANAGEMENT.EXE


restore versions of these files, that have not been affected by the patch.
this means: get your backup tape and find the files from an old image backup.)

when you have restored these files you can upgrade vms. after the upgrade the system
will boot. you now have to reapply the security patch.

Hope this helps....



