(this is a long one!)

Right now, our VAX 6420 is at its max of 256mb using the MS62A-AB 32mb
modules. I would like to put together a proposal to our board regarding
future upgrades, and want to find out some things first...

But first, the reason I am doing this is that our board members will
vote for singular upgrades to our existing system, rather than voting
to upgrade to another grade processor (I have an AXP 7620 in mind).
This is stupid to me, cause we are pretty much at our load limit now,
and adding more memory, CPUs, is not really going to help much, but 
its been hard to convince them of this, even tho they are the first ones
to call me to complain about response time...

So what I am going to do is to propose upgrading from our existing MS62A
modules to MS65A 64mb modules, and adding two 6400 processors, and want
